{"seq":1,"slug":"tooling-landscape","title":"Tooling Landscape","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding-workflows-applied/tooling-landscape","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"three-form-factors","title":"AI 编程工具的三种形态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding-workflows-applied/tooling-landscape/three-form-factors","wordCount":2146,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"harness-concepts","title":"Harness：上下文、权限与工具面","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding-workflows-applied/tooling-landscape/harness-concepts","wordCount":2211,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"choosing-your-setup","title":"按工作流选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding-workflows-applied/tooling-landscape/choosing-your-setup","wordCount":2271,"readingTime":10}],"introHtml":"<p>AI 编程工具看似五花八门，按交互模型可以归为 CLI agent、IDE 内助手与云端异步 agent 三种形态，而决定工具实际表现的往往不是模型本身，而是包裹模型的 harness——上下文供给、权限模型与工具面。本章先厘清三种形态的能力边界与适用场景，再拆解 harness 的核心构件，最后给出按任务类型、自治容忍度、安全约束与价格模型做选型的框架，以及从行内补全到自动化流水线的渐进采纳路径。</p>\n"}